  "_comment": "Panel art for 'The Rainy-Day Noodle Shop' episode 3 (HSK 2). Fetched into the repo by .github/workflows/content-utils.yml, task `manhua-art-fetch`. The `file` names are what data/manhua/noodleshop-hsk2-ep03.json's panels[].art refer to; src/manhuaEpisodes.test.js fails if the two ever disagree.",
